{title: 684 - Hear Our Prayer, O Lord}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #684 • HEAR OUR PRAYER O LORD • 5.5.6.5.2}
{lyricist: Psalm 143:1}
{composer: George Whelpton}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 684}
{meta: tune HEAR OUR PRAYER O LORD}
{meta: meter 5.5.6.5.2}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Hear our prayer, O [A]Lord,
[A7]Hear our prayer, O Lord;
[D]Incline Thine ear to [G]us,
[D/A]And grant [A]us Thy [A7]peace.
[D]Amen.
{end_of_verse}
